{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">滙豐控股發行7.5億英鎊，折合超過79億港元票據。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">滙控發行7.5億英鎊定息及浮息高級無抵押票據，2035年到期，票據將申請在美國紐約交易所上市。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:17.369130+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}